      },
      "message": "fix(ui): cache toolpath overlay lines and the solid box per input (#2201)\n\nThe viewport built the overlay lines of each shown toolpath and the\nworld box of the solids again on each frame. The cost grew with the\noperation count.\n\n- path_line_memo: the lines of each drawn operation, keyed on the path\n  signature, the move count, the warnings, the palette, the dim factor,\n  the chevron arm and the viewport ground.\n- solid_aabb_memo: the solid box, keyed on each model's entity, facet\n  allocation (Weak, ptr_eq) and pose.\n- model::with_toolpath / toolpath_warning_count / toolpath_nonempty read\n  the cached path in place; status_of, the browser tree and the\n  operation page no longer clone each path on each frame.\n\nEach cache has a still-frame build-count test and a changed-input test\nfor each input of its key. The ops probe pins zero builds on still\nframes with eight operations.\n\nRefs #2201\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
